1
00:00:03,400 --> 00:00:07,420
The radiance of the night shines through my window

2
00:00:07,170 --> 00:00:11,370
but the path to immortality is long.

3
00:00:11,600 --> 00:00:16,100
The Eight Views and Nine-Bend Streams are desolate.

4
00:00:15,850 --> 00:00:21,260
Living beings question the miseries of the world over a jar of wine.

5
00:00:22,280 --> 00:00:25,250
Forget about Nirvana and rebirth,

6
00:00:25,400 --> 00:00:28,500
I will break through the waves with my own flesh and blood.

7
00:00:28,250 --> 00:00:33,770
The heavens are vast, so what if I was born mediocre ?

8
00:00:34,720 --> 00:00:37,730
I stare at the Dao in my moments of madness

9
00:00:37,840 --> 00:00:40,730
as the storm rages just below.

10
00:00:40,880 --> 00:00:45,100
I've been thinking about life and death in my dreams.

11
00:00:44,850 --> 00:00:48,090
I've unsheathed my sword to ask the immortals

12
00:00:48,000 --> 00:00:50,940
why the world is a-changing.

13
00:00:50,710 --> 00:00:54,290
Heaven and earth reveals its poignant truths.

14
00:00:54,280 --> 00:00:57,460
Swallow the Four Seas and the Eight Wastelands,

15
00:00:57,210 --> 00:01:00,540
experience all the vicissitudes of life in an instant.

16
00:01:00,450 --> 00:01:03,420
I will defy the light in the sky

17
00:01:03,170 --> 00:01:06,860
to continue to write a new chapter for all things in the three realms of existence.

18
00:01:15,690 --> 00:01:19,300
Just a thought separates mortal from immortal.

19
00:01:19,210 --> 00:01:22,380
Transform your insignificant body into light.

20
00:01:22,290 --> 00:01:25,500
The hardships of the journey

21
00:01:25,370 --> 00:01:28,460
will temper this young man's heart.

22
00:01:28,210 --> 00:01:33,100
If I become a Renegade Immortal, will I hesitate to fight the heavens ?

23
00:01:39,600 --> 00:01:43,730
Renegade Immortal
Subtitles by Bonobosubs
https://discord.gg/Ceckd4pdVA

24
00:01:49,080 --> 00:01:52,450
War God Shrine
Burning Fire country

25
00:01:52,960 --> 00:01:54,810
The formation is activating.

26
00:01:54,880 --> 00:01:56,290
Here they come.

27
00:01:56,680 --> 00:01:57,730
Look !

28
00:01:57,800 --> 00:01:59,090
They're back.

29
00:02:00,440 --> 00:02:02,250
They're finally back !

30
00:01:59,480 --> 00:02:02,690
Xu Si
War God Shrine disciple
Late stage Foundation Establishment

31
00:02:10,000 --> 00:02:11,730
Welcome back Senior Brothers, Sister Sister.

32
00:02:11,480 --> 00:02:13,290
How was the harvest this time ?

33
00:02:13,040 --> 00:02:14,930
Did you find any powerful artifacts ?

34
00:02:14,680 --> 00:02:16,450
Tell us how it went !

35
00:02:16,320 --> 00:02:20,090
Good, you guys endured the trial of the Foreign Battlefield.

36
00:02:20,040 --> 00:02:22,930
The three of you have greatly improved your cultivation.

37
00:02:24,080 --> 00:02:27,610
Huo Hongfei
War God Shrine Elder
Early stage Core Formation

38
00:02:24,880 --> 00:02:28,370
It's a shame so few of you returned.

39
00:02:31,960 --> 00:02:33,050
Elder,

40
00:02:33,440 --> 00:02:35,290
Junior Brother Ma Liang is still inside.

41
00:02:35,040 --> 00:02:36,570
The situation was critical

42
00:02:36,320 --> 00:02:38,050
so he told the us to leave first.

43
00:02:37,800 --> 00:02:38,970
He’ll catch up soon.

44
00:02:38,760 --> 00:02:40,970
Junior Brother Ma Liang survived ?

45
00:02:40,720 --> 00:02:42,130
Ma Liang isn’t dead !?

46
00:02:42,040 --> 00:02:43,010
Silence.

47
00:02:43,320 --> 00:02:45,490
Were you hoping for Ma Liang's death ?

48
00:02:45,840 --> 00:02:47,850
Is this how your master taught you !?

49
00:02:49,120 --> 00:02:50,370
Don’t worry Junior Sister,

50
00:02:50,880 --> 00:02:53,730
Junior Brother Ma Liang spent 50 years in the Foreign Battlefield

51
00:02:53,520 --> 00:02:55,290
so his temperament has changed.

52
00:02:55,320 --> 00:02:56,490
I don't think

53
00:02:56,240 --> 00:02:58,410
that he will bother you anymore.

54
00:02:59,000 --> 00:03:02,490
Zhou An
War God Shrine disciple
Late stage Foundation Establishment

55
00:02:59,960 --> 00:03:01,520
What’s there to fear ?

56
00:03:01,280 --> 00:03:03,020
If he dares to harass you again,

57
00:03:02,800 --> 00:03:03,970
I’ll handle it.

58
00:03:29,000 --> 00:03:29,970
This is…

59
00:03:30,720 --> 00:03:32,570
such a powerful cold aura...

60
00:03:37,440 --> 00:03:38,970
This aura…

61
00:03:39,400 --> 00:03:40,650
Is this Ma Liang ?

62
00:03:41,360 --> 00:03:42,690
Disciple Ma Liang

63
00:03:42,440 --> 00:03:44,090
pays respects to Elder Huo.

64
00:03:44,160 --> 00:03:45,930
I'm glad you made it back.

65
00:03:45,800 --> 00:03:47,050
Come with me.

66
00:03:47,320 --> 00:03:49,210
Disciple has urgent matters to deal with.

67
00:03:49,760 --> 00:03:52,490
I'll come after I'm done dealing with them.

68
00:03:53,160 --> 00:03:56,050
Here are the items I collected over these 50 years.

69
00:03:56,000 --> 00:03:57,810
The artifacts were destroyed

70
00:03:57,600 --> 00:03:59,450
so only these materials remain.

71
00:03:59,800 --> 00:04:02,690
This kid exudes an unusually cold aura...

72
00:04:03,320 --> 00:04:05,970
I should report this to the Sect Leader.

73
00:04:20,360 --> 00:04:22,850
Let's hide here, Ah Niu won’t find us.

74
00:04:25,560 --> 00:04:27,730
Found you !

75
00:04:43,360 --> 00:04:45,490
An Immortal ! An Immortal !

76
00:04:45,760 --> 00:04:47,610
My mother said that

77
00:04:47,360 --> 00:04:51,090
the volcanoes of the Burning Fire country would've errupted long ago

78
00:04:50,840 --> 00:04:53,290
if they weren't sealed by the Immortals !

79
00:04:53,880 --> 00:04:55,690
I want to become an Immortal too !

80
00:04:55,840 --> 00:04:58,690
Kids, come back for dinner.

81
00:04:58,760 --> 00:04:59,810
Okay !

82
00:05:02,320 --> 00:05:03,700
We're going home !

83
00:05:02,880 --> 00:05:03,890
Mom,

84
00:05:03,640 --> 00:05:05,570
I saw an Immortal today !

85
00:05:06,240 --> 00:05:07,130
Really ?

86
00:05:12,200 --> 00:05:14,570
I need to find a place to cultivate...

87
00:05:20,360 --> 00:05:22,470
I'm glad I held out this long...

88
00:05:22,720 --> 00:05:24,570
Let's first inspect this body.

89
00:05:30,960 --> 00:05:33,210
So this is my Sea of Consciousness.

90
00:05:58,120 --> 00:06:01,690
This red lightning must be the Ji Realm refined by the Law of the World.

91
00:06:01,840 --> 00:06:04,050
Since it resisted the Law of the World,

92
00:06:04,120 --> 00:06:05,730
it must be powerful.

93
00:06:26,760 --> 00:06:30,690
The Ji Realm can actually awaken the Heaven Defying Bead and my sword ?

94
00:06:55,240 --> 00:06:58,850
If this Ji Realm Divine Sense were to fill my Sea of Counsciousness,

95
00:06:59,360 --> 00:07:03,770
even the Law of the World would pale before me.

96
00:07:35,040 --> 00:07:37,050
They must have

97
00:07:37,200 --> 00:07:39,210
outstanding form and spirit !

98
00:07:52,760 --> 00:07:54,770
Father… Mother…

99
00:07:56,240 --> 00:07:58,930
It’s me… I’m Tie Zhu.

100
00:07:59,520 --> 00:08:01,210
Do you still recognize me ?

101
00:08:01,760 --> 00:08:03,090
Once I recover,

102
00:08:03,640 --> 00:08:06,290
I’ll find my way back to the country of Zhao.

103
00:08:07,760 --> 00:08:09,730
I'll deal with Teng Huayuan...

104
00:08:09,560 --> 00:08:11,450
Blood for blood.

105
00:08:21,520 --> 00:08:23,370
Ge Yang and Xu Hao’s bags of holding

106
00:08:23,120 --> 00:08:24,970
had this piece of refined iron.

107
00:08:24,960 --> 00:08:26,250
It's top quality.

108
00:08:28,000 --> 00:08:30,050
I don’t know anything about artifact crafting

109
00:08:29,800 --> 00:08:31,730
so I can't make a new sword.

110
00:08:32,000 --> 00:08:33,290
This will have to do.

111
00:08:42,480 --> 00:08:44,770
1 year later

112
00:08:45,560 --> 00:08:46,330
Senior,

113
00:08:47,000 --> 00:08:49,450
This body is already Middle stage Foundation Establishment.

114
00:08:49,400 --> 00:08:51,330
With the Ji Realm,

115
00:08:51,080 --> 00:08:53,970
I can defeat any Foundation Establishment cultivator.

116
00:08:53,760 --> 00:08:55,850
I'm even confident in facing

117
00:08:55,600 --> 00:08:57,330
Early stage Core Formation.

118
00:09:12,120 --> 00:09:14,610
What is this wood element spiritual energy ?

119
00:09:17,440 --> 00:09:20,610
Burning Gold Mountain Range

120
00:09:21,840 --> 00:09:24,450
Zhou Gang
Corpse Sect disciple
Middle stage Foundation Establishment

121
00:09:21,000 --> 00:09:24,450
Junior Sister An, is this your first time picking Burning Gold Fruits ?

122
00:09:24,720 --> 00:09:25,490
Yes

123
00:09:24,440 --> 00:09:26,490
An Zi
Corpse Sect disciple
Middle stage Foundation Establishment

124
00:09:24,440 --> 00:09:26,490
Ma Yu
Corpse Sect disciple
Middle stage Foundation Establishment

125
00:09:26,040 --> 00:09:28,290
Our Burning Fire country is full of volcanoes

126
00:09:28,040 --> 00:09:30,290
and the spiritual energy is the fire element.

127
00:09:30,040 --> 00:09:33,970
Prolonged exposition to it can harm cultivators.

128
00:09:33,720 --> 00:09:36,450
Only the Soul Harmony Pills made from Burning Gold Fruits

129
00:09:36,200 --> 00:09:38,290
can regulate our spiritual energy.

130
00:09:38,080 --> 00:09:40,930
Are Burning Gold Fruits only found in the Burning Gold Mountains ?

131
00:09:41,080 --> 00:09:42,610
Exactly.

132
00:09:42,360 --> 00:09:44,330
When the fruits are ripe,

133
00:09:44,560 --> 00:09:47,250
disciples from all 4 sects come to harvest them.

134
00:09:59,920 --> 00:10:02,970
The other 3 sects have already entered,

135
00:10:02,760 --> 00:10:05,170
why are we still waiting here ?

136
00:10:05,360 --> 00:10:07,610
Blue mist means the fruits are ripe

137
00:10:07,840 --> 00:10:09,330
and safe to harvest.

138
00:10:09,560 --> 00:10:11,170
Since the mist isn't out yet,

139
00:10:10,920 --> 00:10:13,330
that means there is still poisonous gas in the volcano.

140
00:10:13,080 --> 00:10:14,810
We’ll be in danger

141
00:10:14,560 --> 00:10:15,970
if we go down now.

142
00:10:17,320 --> 00:10:18,290
Enough,

143
00:10:18,040 --> 00:10:19,090
let’s go down.

144
00:10:21,120 --> 00:10:22,530
Hey, you !

145
00:10:22,760 --> 00:10:23,810
What ?

146
00:10:23,800 --> 00:10:26,730
We only harvest 10 fruits per year

147
00:10:26,760 --> 00:10:28,810
to avoid damaging the roots.

148
00:10:28,560 --> 00:10:30,530
Yet you severed the entire root !?

149
00:10:31,200 --> 00:10:32,930
No matter which sect you're from,

150
00:10:32,680 --> 00:10:35,450
you will pay for this offense !

151
00:10:40,200 --> 00:10:41,250
Die.

152
00:10:48,800 --> 00:10:49,930
Damn it, damn it.

153
00:10:51,360 --> 00:10:53,010
Take one more step

154
00:10:53,840 --> 00:10:55,170
and you will die.

155
00:10:59,160 --> 00:11:00,410
A Nascent Soul ?

156
00:11:00,160 --> 00:11:01,890
Fellow cultivator, spare me.

157
00:11:01,640 --> 00:11:03,050
Please have mercy.

158
00:11:02,480 --> 00:11:06,010
Xu Liguo's Nascent Soul
Tian Gang Sect disciple

159
00:11:03,360 --> 00:11:07,210
I’m Xu Liguo, disciple of the Tian Gang Sect of a rank 4 country.

160
00:11:07,040 --> 00:11:08,810
I know I offended you earlier.

161
00:11:08,560 --> 00:11:10,050
Let’s talk this through.

162
00:11:09,800 --> 00:11:11,370
Please, don’t act rashly.

163
00:11:12,240 --> 00:11:16,970
Cultivators stand no chance against the power of the souls here.

164
00:11:17,200 --> 00:11:20,050
If wandering souls enter the mortal world,

165
00:11:19,800 --> 00:11:21,570
they’ll be called devils.

166
00:11:26,120 --> 00:11:27,170
Devils ?

167
00:11:27,680 --> 00:11:28,770
Interesting...

168
00:11:31,280 --> 00:11:33,050
What are you doing !?

169
00:11:42,040 --> 00:11:44,530
I had a Nascent Soul cultivation when I had a body,

170
00:11:44,640 --> 00:11:46,690
a flick of my finger could kill you !

171
00:11:48,080 --> 00:11:49,650
Why isn’t he speaking ?

172
00:11:50,400 --> 00:11:52,290
Is he plotting something ?

173
00:11:52,400 --> 00:11:53,730
Don’t do anything reckless.

174
00:11:53,480 --> 00:11:54,930
Let me tell you something,

175
00:11:54,720 --> 00:11:57,170
if I could afford a Nascent Soul body

176
00:11:57,240 --> 00:11:59,850
instead of this cheap Foundation Establishment one,

177
00:11:59,760 --> 00:12:03,250
I would crush a Foundation Establishment brat like you !

178
00:12:03,000 --> 00:12:04,250
Shut up.

179
00:12:05,680 --> 00:12:06,730
Fellow cultivator !

180
00:12:07,160 --> 00:12:08,210
Let’s talk this through.

181
00:12:08,240 --> 00:12:09,450
Let’s talk this through.

182
00:12:10,080 --> 00:12:11,450
If you spare me,

183
00:12:11,440 --> 00:12:13,410
I’ll agree to anything !

184
00:12:13,640 --> 00:12:15,770
Please calm down, fellow cultivator.

185
00:12:17,080 --> 00:12:20,050
If wandering souls can devour cultivators regardless of their cultivation level,

186
00:12:19,800 --> 00:12:22,970
maybe I could try to refine one here ?

187
00:12:29,560 --> 00:12:31,890
If I had an army of wandering souls,

188
00:12:32,480 --> 00:12:36,770
it would make my vengeance against Teng Huayuan easier.

189
00:12:41,120 --> 00:12:42,330
Hey, hey, hey !

190
00:12:47,520 --> 00:12:48,450
Fellow cultivator…

191
00:12:48,280 --> 00:12:50,570
Please calm down, fellow cultivator !

192
00:12:57,920 --> 00:13:00,330
I erased the original consciousness.

193
00:13:01,160 --> 00:13:03,810
He really was at Nascent Soul...

194
00:13:06,840 --> 00:13:08,330
Who are you ?

195
00:13:08,480 --> 00:13:10,690
And who am I ?

196
00:13:41,760 --> 00:13:42,930
Eat him.

197
00:13:58,920 --> 00:14:00,450
Let me out !

198
00:14:04,120 --> 00:14:06,970
You've really pissed me off !

199
00:14:52,160 --> 00:14:54,690
The devil is done.

200
00:14:59,400 --> 00:15:01,010
You’re courting death !

201
00:15:04,760 --> 00:15:06,370
Hide inside this.

202
00:15:06,320 --> 00:15:08,770
You're not allowed to come out unless I call you.

203
00:15:35,920 --> 00:15:37,770
He’s even stronger now...

204
00:15:37,640 --> 00:15:39,810
Lin Tao pays respects to Master.

205
00:15:41,080 --> 00:15:43,290
Greetings... Senior...

206
00:15:48,280 --> 00:15:49,570
Master,

207
00:15:49,320 --> 00:15:52,210
here are the items you requested 3 days ago.

208
00:15:52,800 --> 00:15:54,930
This is the Artifact Crafting Hall’s jade slip

209
00:15:54,880 --> 00:15:57,090
with detailed artifact crafting methods.

210
00:16:01,160 --> 00:16:04,650
Master, the maps are in the Scripture Pavilion’s top floor.

211
00:16:05,000 --> 00:16:07,890
My cultivation was too low to access it.

212
00:16:09,480 --> 00:16:10,370
10 days !

213
00:16:10,480 --> 00:16:12,370
Master, give me 10 more days !

214
00:16:12,440 --> 00:16:14,610
My cousin will be on duty in 10 days,

215
00:16:14,360 --> 00:16:16,330
I'll ask him to make a copy.

216
00:16:17,320 --> 00:16:18,770
If you succeed,

217
00:16:18,960 --> 00:16:21,010
I’ll return your Soul Blood when I leave

218
00:16:20,760 --> 00:16:22,570
the Burning Fire country.

219
00:16:26,200 --> 00:16:27,450
Master...

220
00:16:28,080 --> 00:16:30,530
I would've returned your Soul Blood now...

221
00:16:30,880 --> 00:16:33,850
But this jade slip’s tracking spell

222
00:16:33,960 --> 00:16:36,650
voids your achievement.

223
00:16:37,000 --> 00:16:38,290
I won’t kill you.

224
00:16:38,240 --> 00:16:40,130
But whether I return your Soul Blood

225
00:16:40,280 --> 00:16:42,090
will depend on what you do next.

226
00:16:42,160 --> 00:16:44,210
I'm glad I didn’t activate the tracking spell

227
00:16:44,040 --> 00:16:45,850
to ask teacher for help.

228
00:16:45,800 --> 00:16:47,970
If I did, I'd be dead already.

229
00:16:48,920 --> 00:16:52,450
Senior, I couldn’t copy the Divine Path.

230
00:16:52,200 --> 00:16:54,170
I tried my hardest to memorize it

231
00:16:54,160 --> 00:16:55,650
but once I left the hall,

232
00:16:55,400 --> 00:16:57,690
I wasn't able to remember the Divine Path.

233
00:16:58,360 --> 00:17:00,290
You’re using Ma Liang’s identity

234
00:17:00,240 --> 00:17:01,650
so if you’re willing

235
00:17:01,400 --> 00:17:03,010
you could visit the War God Shrine

236
00:17:02,760 --> 00:17:04,410
to study the Divine Path.

237
00:17:05,080 --> 00:17:07,250
This Divine Path is very weird...

238
00:17:08,840 --> 00:17:11,250
You don't need to be so on guard near me.

239
00:17:11,840 --> 00:17:13,490
As long as you don’t provoke me,

240
00:17:13,240 --> 00:17:14,810
I’ll return your Soul Blood

241
00:17:14,560 --> 00:17:16,370
when I leave the country.

242
00:17:16,760 --> 00:17:18,530
But if you plot against me,

243
00:17:18,680 --> 00:17:20,690
don’t blame me for being ruthless.

244
00:17:20,560 --> 00:17:21,850
You three may leave.

245
00:17:22,320 --> 00:17:23,370
Lin Tao,

246
00:17:23,760 --> 00:17:26,130
I’ll wait for you here in 10 days.

247
00:17:40,760 --> 00:17:43,050
Going to the War God Shrine is too risky.

248
00:17:42,960 --> 00:17:45,090
Even if these three are not scheming,

249
00:17:45,640 --> 00:17:47,850
if I'm exposed for stealing this body,

250
00:17:47,600 --> 00:17:49,010
I'll be in trouble.

251
00:17:48,760 --> 00:17:50,210
Little friend...

252
00:17:50,600 --> 00:17:55,210
Will you give me my disciple's Soul Blood ?

253
00:18:06,200 --> 00:18:09,730
Feng Luan
War God Shrine Ancestor
Early stage Nascent Soul

254
00:18:14,450 --> 00:20:16,770
Wang Lin says he reached Middle stage Foundation Establishment with this body but he was showed a few episodes before as Late stage Foundation Establishment in his character card. That is because his body and soul's cultivations are not synchronized. In normal circumstances, the body and the soul should be the same level but here Wang Lin's soul became a Soul Devourer and devoured wandering souls during hundreds of years so his soul's cultivation reached Late stage. Now that he has cultivated anew (he started from zero and it took 1 year outside but 10 times as much inside the Heaven Defying Bead), his body is at Middle stage Foundation Establishment.

The Corpse Sect is a tentacular organization that has branches everywhere to sell bodies to cultivators. So this Corpse Sect is not the same as the one in Zhao. In fact, all Corpse Sects on this planet are branches of the real Corpse Sect.

255
00:18:20,190 --> 00:18:26,080
I've been walking this path for endless years

256
00:18:22,490 --> 00:18:26,080
just to catch a glimpse of your silhouette.

257
00:18:26,470 --> 00:18:31,680
Is it the compass of fate

258
00:18:28,310 --> 00:18:31,680
that wrote this outcome for us ?

259
00:18:31,590 --> 00:18:37,600
The heavens want to erase your existence,

260
00:18:37,470 --> 00:18:43,320
that's the obsession guiding me.

261
00:18:43,350 --> 00:18:48,920
Is this the path to uncover

262
00:18:45,230 --> 00:18:48,920
truths from falsehoods ?

263
00:18:48,950 --> 00:18:54,520
In a world of murk and shadow,

264
00:18:50,850 --> 00:18:54,520
only the flame of truth can light the way.

265
00:18:54,310 --> 00:19:00,240
Look at them all,

266
00:18:57,190 --> 00:19:00,240
being carried by the waves.

267
00:19:00,430 --> 00:19:04,880
Look at them all,

268
00:19:02,590 --> 00:19:04,880
being drowned.

269
00:19:04,710 --> 00:19:08,200
I don't want to believe in whoever decides fate,

270
00:19:07,990 --> 00:19:11,280
I will let the world refine my soul.

271
00:19:11,160 --> 00:19:16,840
So what if I become an Immortal and defy the heavens ?

272
00:19:12,850 --> 00:19:16,840
I will fight.

273
00:19:16,590 --> 00:19:19,960
I'll break through the abyss of despair

274
00:19:19,710 --> 00:19:23,000
to finally learn who I really am.

275
00:19:22,750 --> 00:19:28,360
My body is stained by the bloody color of slaughter,

276
00:19:24,630 --> 00:19:28,360
I embrace this obsession.

277
00:19:28,110 --> 00:19:31,320
I won't glance back at the wasteland I left behind.

278
00:19:31,070 --> 00:19:34,120
Even if this suffering shatters my soul

279
00:19:33,870 --> 00:19:39,600
and I'm reborn countless times in hell,

280
00:19:35,910 --> 00:19:39,600
I'll still fight.

281
00:19:39,550 --> 00:19:42,960
It's hard to avoid loneliness

282
00:19:42,710 --> 00:19:46,000
when you are above everyone else.

283
00:19:45,750 --> 00:19:51,680
Can a moth that has witnessed the flames of a Suzaku

284
00:19:48,070 --> 00:19:51,680
be afraid of a firefly ?
